B.a5Y=s(["Leaving a group plays its opening backwards; another group opened from a group rebuilds the screen.","A splash with the logo and an intro: the dark opens like a lens and the logo flies to its place.","Parts of a screen jump in more visibly; windows close with a fade.","Results: every fact in the full view. Names in disputes in members' colors.","Tapping a member on top opens their card; only the host renames others."],t.s)
